course: dictionary
lesson: 15840
title: Words that mean not less
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Un- at the start of a word often means not. So undiminished means not made smaller, weaker or less. «Her enthusiasm remained undiminished.» Remained tells you it stayed the same, and enthusiasm means excitement, so her excitement did not fade.
explain: Try your meaning in the sentence. «Her enthusiasm stayed as strong as before» fits, so you have understood the word. Undiminished is a formal word, so you will often find it in news, exam questions and serious writing.
explain: In maths, the same idea works with numbers. An undiminished amount has not gone down. «If you take nothing away from 12, the total stays undiminished at 12.»
fact: Undiminished means not made smaller, weaker or less.
fact: The un- at the start means not, so undiminished means not diminished.
fact: «Her enthusiasm remained undiminished.» means her excitement stayed just as strong.
fact: In maths, an undiminished amount has not gone down.
fact: A good check is to say "still as strong as before" in place of the word. If it fits, your meaning is right.
exercise: «Her enthusiasm remained undiminished.» What does undiminished mean? | Made very large | Lost completely | *Not made smaller or weaker | Hidden away
exercise: «After three hours of running, his energy was still undiminished.» What does this tell us? | He was tired and wanted to sleep | He had eaten too much lunch | His energy had run out | *His energy was still as strong as before
exercise: In maths, the number 12 stayed undiminished after we took nothing away. What does that mean? | The total has been rounded up | The total has doubled | *The total has not gone down | The total is now zero
test: Which word means about the same as undiminished? | Shrunk | Weakened | *Full strength | Lessened
test: Which sentence means the cheering stayed just as loud? | The cheering was cut short | The cheering ran away | The cheering was barely a whisper | *The cheering stayed undiminished all afternoon
exam: Read this: «The rain went on for hours, yet the fans' spirits were undiminished.» What does undiminished tell us about the fans? | They had lost their voices | They were cold and wet forever | *They were as cheerful as ever | They had gone home early
